---
 title: Tandoori Chicken Tenders
---
Coat @chicken tenders{} generously in @greek yoghurt (strained){}.

Season with @salt{} and @pepper{} to taste.

Add spices in decreasing intensity: @dhaniya powder{}, then @haldi{}, then @laal mirchi{}.

Mix in @ginger garlic paste{} to taste.

Heat a pan to medium and add enough @sunflower seed oil{}.

Cook the chicken until it is no longer springy -- use rubber tongs to test. If using a non-stick pan, be sure to use rubber tongs only.
